  "question": {
    "text": "Two charges $+q$ and $-q$ are placed at points $A$ and $B$ respectively which are at a distance $2 L$ apart. $C$ is the mid point of $A$ and $B$. The workdone in moving a charge $+Q$ along the semicircle $\\operatorname{CSD}\\left(W_1\\right)$ and along the line $\\operatorname{CBD}\\left(W_2\\right)$ are\n\n\n<img width=\"250px\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/_SrvelMhBSctOStLeS_OSTXt4zLD80MwBbeyYLiSrTw.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "5INCu",
      "text": "$\\frac{-\\mathrm{Qq}}{6 \\pi \\epsilon_0 \\mathrm{~L}}, \\frac{-\\mathrm{Qq}}{6 \\pi \\epsilon_0 \\mathrm{~L}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "UugMQ",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\mathrm{qQ}}{4 \\pi \\epsilon_0 \\mathrm{~L}}, \\frac{\\mathrm{qQ}}{4 \\pi \\epsilon_0 \\mathrm{~L}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tPhRp",
      "text": "$\\frac{-Q q}{6 \\pi \\epsilon_0 L}, \\frac{-Q q}{12 \\pi \\epsilon_0 L}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "k7H2i",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\mathrm{qQ}}{4 \\pi \\in_0 \\mathrm{~L}}, 0$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\text {  } W_{C S D}=Q\\left(V_{D A}-V_{C A}\\right)=\\frac{Q q}{4 \\pi \\epsilon_0 L}\\left[\\frac{1}{3}-1\\right]=\\frac{-2 Q q}{12 \\pi \\epsilon_0 L}=\\frac{-Q q}{6 \\pi \\epsilon_0 L}=W_{C B D} \\\\ & W_{C B D}=W_{C S D} \\text { path independent }\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
